- **Removed errors.** `MonoklError` keeps `Io`, `Walk`, `RegexBuild`, `NonUtf8Path` and `TooManyTerms`; `FileIoError` keeps `Read`. `ToDomainError::to_domain_error` no longer takes an `ErrorContext`.

